+# shipping Specification
+
+## Purpose
+Defines how shipping is priced and when it is free, so customers are charged what the shop promises.
+
+## Requirements
+
+### Requirement: Free shipping from €50.00
+Shipping SHALL be free when the goods come to €50.00 or more, after every discount and before VAT. Below that, it is priced by the parcel's total weight: up to 1 kg €4.90, up to 5 kg €8.90, up to 20 kg €14.90, heavier €29.90.
+
+#### Scenario: Goods exactly €50.00
+- **WHEN** goods after discounts are €50.00
+- **THEN** shipping is €0.00
+
+#### Scenario: Goods just below the threshold
+- **WHEN** goods after discounts are €49.99 and the parcel weighs 500 g
+- **THEN** shipping is €4.90
+
+#### Scenario: Discount brings goods to €50.00
+- **WHEN** a basket's gross is above €50.00 and discounts bring it to exactly €50.00
+- **THEN** shipping is €0.00
