+# vat Specification
+
+## Purpose
+Defines VAT rates and how VAT is rounded, so amounts match accounting to the cent.
+
+## Requirements
+
+### Requirement: Line VAT rounds half up
+VAT SHALL be computed per order line on the line's net amount after every discount, at the rate of the product's VAT class (standard 22%, reduced 10%, super-reduced 4%, exempt 0%), and rounded half up to the cent.
+
+#### Scenario: Half a cent or more rounds up
+- **WHEN** a line of one item at €1.99 has standard-rate VAT
+- **THEN** the line's VAT is €0.44
+
+#### Scenario: Below half a cent rounds down
+- **WHEN** a line's exact VAT is 0.49 cent over a whole cent
+- **THEN** the line's VAT is that whole cent
